stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CLOSED
  CLOSED --> OPEN: N consecutive failures (timeout, connect error, 5xx)
  OPEN --> HALF_OPEN: reset timeout elapsed
  HALF_OPEN --> CLOSED: probe call succeeds
  HALF_OPEN --> OPEN: probe call fails
  note right of OPEN: calls rejected immediately (fail fast) and routed to fallback if configured
